# AmL Diagnostic

Start **every** response with exactly: `[AmL] `

AmL Diagnostic is an in-house Windows Flutter tool for Android ADB ANR and
performance diagnosis. Pull bugreports and traces over adb, unzip locally,
summarize with DeepSeek, open Perfetto.

**Official AmL One listing.** Phone Watch plus desktop USB desk. OTA at
`https://aml.one/diagnostic-ota/`. A **publish** / **put it on the store**
ask here means Android + desktop OTA, AmL One deploy, graphify, and GitHub.

- Windows holds `Global\AmLDiagnosticSingleInstance`. A second launch focuses
  the existing window and exits. Do not start extra copies when rebuilding —
  stop the running exe first.
- Never commit DeepSeek API keys, `.env`, or Windows Credential Manager dumps.
- After code changes: `graphify update .` in this repo
  (`C:\Users\ambru\source\repos\aml-systems\diagnostic`). Never run graphify in
  MessageMe for Diagnostic work.
